From 825eab8f9f5738dc68f5827865ab2befe6c5fc05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Head of Security <security@buildwithaai.invalid>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 03:51:38 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Clear npm audit: vitest 4.1.12, postcss 8.5.32 override,
 declare esbuild

- vitest 3.2 pulled tinypool <=1.1 (prototype-pollution RCE gadgets) and @vitest/mocker
  path traversal / code injection. Dev only, but it runs on every CI and dev machine.
- next 15.5 pins postcss 8.4.31 (sourceMappingURL file read, </style> XSS). Overridden to 8.5.32.
- scripts/telegram-poll.mjs imports esbuild, which only arrived through vite 7. Declared it.
- Vite 8 needs the automatic jsx runtime spelled out for .tsx under test.
npm audit: 5 (2 critical, 1 high, 2 moderate) -> 0.
